{"turn_id": "d06-t1", "session_id": "d06", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bd_users_twitter_reddit", "text": "Twitter and Reddit users with a BD diagnosis will be identified automatically via self-reported diagnosis statements, such as 'I was diagnosed with BD-I last week'.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "diagnosis_patterns_extension", "text": "To identify users via self-reported diagnosis statements, the study will extend on the diagnosis patterns and terms for BD provided by BIBREF47.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "blogs_manual_consent", "text": "Relevant blogs will be manually identified, and their authors will be contacted to obtain informed consent for using their texts.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "data_sources", "text": "Data relevant for BD in general and for personal recovery in BD will be collected from three sources: Twitter, Reddit (focusing on mental health-related content unlike previous work), and blogs authored by affected individuals.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d06-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d06-t2", "session_id": "d06", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "twitter_reddit_automated_self_report", "text": "在 Twitter 和 Reddit 上，患有双相障碍诊断的用户将通过自我报告的诊断陈述被自动识别，例如“我上周被诊断为 BD-I”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "extend_diagnosis_patterns", "text": "为了进行这种自动识别，作者计划扩展先前工作提供的双相障碍诊断模式和术语。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "blogs_manual_identification_consent", "text": "相关博客将被人工识别，并且会联系其作者以获得使用其文本的知情同意。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "three_data_sources", "text": "计划从三个来源收集与一般双相障碍以及双相障碍个人康复相关的数据：Twitter、Reddit（与先前工作不同，聚焦于心理健康相关内容）以及与患者本人撰写的博客。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "collect_analyse_diagnosed_social_media", "text": "该跨学科项目将收集和分析被诊断为双相障碍个体的社交媒体数据，以研究其康复经历。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-8501c609aafc1a9ab4878246"}]}, {"key": "prior_datasets_limitations", "text": "先前的 Twitter 数据集无法用于进一步研究，而两个 Reddit 数据集则刻意删除了与心理健康相关的内容，使其无法用于分析心理健康在网上如何被谈论。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d06-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
